  "description": "Proposed erection of a rear dormer loft conversion, including two windows to the front roof slope and one flatroof rooflight. ",
  "development_type": "Minor all other minor developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-6d08de5e-7fff-3b38-8b1d-5330f80242b7&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.2;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;padding:0pt 5pt 0pt 5pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;﻿&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;The proposal is considered unacceptable in terms of the impact on the character and appearance of the application site and the surrounding area. The proposal due to its scale and dominance in combination with its visibility from the neighbouring open space would result in unacceptable levels of harm to the existing dwelling and the surrounding area.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p dir=&quot;ltr&quot; style=&quot;line-height:1.2;text-align: justify;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;padding:0pt 5pt 0pt 5pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;The proposal would fail to comply with&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;with Policies D1, D3, D4&amp;nbsp; of The London Plan, Policy LP1 of the Hackney Local Plan 2033, and the Council’s REA SPD 2025.&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
